      For Problem (e), to determine whether the control measures have eradicated the pests, we
  can use the regression model with longitudinal data to modify the spread model by taking the
  changes of pest population with human intervention into account. With data on population




                                                                型
  changes after taking controlled measures, we can determine the point in time and evidence of
  pest eradication.




