  4       Analysis and Modelling
  4.1 Spread of sparrow hornet over time
     After analyzing the provided data set, we can ensure that the spread of sparrow hornet is
  predictable.




                                                                型
      Understanding the role of biotic (species ecology, predation and interspeciﬁc competition)
  and abiotic (anthropogenic role, climate change, geographical barriers) factors has become the
  major challenge in ecology and biogeography. In this problem, however, we rely on abiotic




                                                              模
  variables because little is known about other biotic factors, such as species evolution, predators
  and competitors, which may aﬀect the location of sparrow hornet [7].




